#Next Updates / Roadmap

Planned features for Symbolic.

## Colored ASCII
Render each character in the color of the original pixel. Imported photos will keep their colors instead of being converted to grayscale. Works great with the `█▓▒░` block set.

## Ctrl+Z — Undo
Undo / redo actions with `Ctrl+Z` / `Ctrl+Y`. Keeps a history stack of canvas states so you can safely experiment while drawing.

## Theme Switcher
Switch between multiple color schemes on the fly:

All UI colors change instantly — background, buttons, accents, canvas.

